<%#
  /llms.txt and /llms-full.txt (https://llmstxt.org). A text/plain template, so
  Rails doesn't HTML-escape it and "Tubes & Pipes" stays readable.
-%>
<% address = Catalog::ADDRESS -%>
# <%= @company[:name] %>

> <%= @company[:name] %> (<%= @company[:legal_name] %>) is a steel manufacturer and supplier based in <%= address[:locality] %>, <%= address[:region] %>, <%= address[:country] %>, established in <%= @company[:established] %>. <%= @company[:summary] %>

It manufactures and supplies structural steel sections, TMT reinforcement bars, tubes and pipes, and steel sheets and plates for infrastructure, industrial, fabrication and construction projects. Routine delivery covers <%= @company[:area_served].to_sentence %>; other states are served on full-load dispatch. Every dispatch carries a mill test certificate.

## Key facts

- Founded: <%= @company[:established] %>, <%= address[:locality] %>, <%= address[:region] %>
<% Catalog::STATS.each do |stat| -%>
- <%= stat[:label] %>: <%= stat[:value] %><%= stat[:suffix] %> (<%= stat[:note].downcase_first %>)
<% end -%>
- Approvals and registrations: <%= Catalog::APPROVALS.join("; ") %>
- Services: <%= Catalog::CAPABILITIES.map { |c| c[:title].downcase }.to_sentence %>

## Contact

- Address: <%= @company[:address] %>
- Phone: <%= [ @company[:phone], @company[:phone_alt] ].compact_blank.join(", ") %>
- Email: <%= @company[:email] %>
- Hours: <%= @company[:hours] %>
- Request a quotation: <%= absolute_url(contact_path) %>

## Products

<% @products.each do |product| -%>
- [<%= product.title %>](<%= absolute_url(product_path(product.slug)) %>): <%= product.category %>. <%= product.summary %>
<% end -%>

## Pages

- [Home](<%= absolute_url(root_path) %>): overview, product families, applications and instant quotes
- [Product catalogue](<%= absolute_url(products_path) %>): every product family with sizes and grades
- [About](<%= absolute_url(about_path) %>): history since <%= @company[:established] %>, values and milestones
- [Plant & facility](<%= absolute_url(plant_path) %>): melting, casting, rolling, testing and dispatch
- [Clients & approvals](<%= absolute_url(clients_path) %>): sectors supplied and certifications held
- [Contact](<%= absolute_url(contact_path) %>): sales desk, enquiry form and FAQs
<% unless @full -%>

## Optional

- [Full catalogue with specifications](<%= absolute_url("/llms-full.txt") %>): sizes, grades, specifications and FAQs as plain text
- [Sitemap](<%= absolute_url("/sitemap.xml") %>)
<% end -%>
<% if @full -%>

## Product specifications
<% @products.each do |product| -%>

### <%= product.title %>

URL: <%= absolute_url(product_path(product.slug)) %>
Category: <%= product.category %>

<%= product.description.presence || product.summary %>
<% if product.spec_pairs.any? -%>

Specifications:
<% product.spec_pairs.each do |label, value| -%>
- <%= label %>: <%= value %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
<% if product.sizes.any? -%>

Sizes: <%= product.sizes.join(", ") %>
<% end -%>
<% if product.applications.any? -%>

Applications: <%= product.applications.join(", ") %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

## Manufacturing process
<% Catalog::PROCESS.each do |stage| -%>

<%= stage[:step] %>. **<%= stage[:title] %>**: <%= stage[:body] %>
<% end -%>

## Frequently asked questions
<% @faqs.each do |faq| -%>

### <%= faq[:question] %>

<%= faq[:answer] %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
